      "title": "Research Fellow  (Life Cycle Assessment of Manufacture and Recycling of New Energy Devices) - School of Metallurgy and Materials - 108037 - Grade 7",
      "description": "This post will be part of a new European project, SuMaCer, on the Sustainable Manufacturing of Functional Ceramics for Europe’s Net-Zero Industry Energy Devices. Your part in this project will be to embed life cycle thinking across the project, by engaging directly with the researchers involved in designing and running new manufacturing processes to gather the data required for Life Cycle Assessment (LCA) calculations and to advise them on how to improve the sustainability of their processes. In addition, you will track the economic and circularity indicators of the prototype devices.\n\nPosting closes: 2026-10-27",
